Use one narrowly scoped metadata query only if prior cached evidence is insufficient.

Do not search the entire HDS table repeatedly.

Distinguish direct matches, derived relationships and unapproved proxies.

## 7. PRIORITY 4 — REPRESENTATIVE BOND FUTURES BASIS

Choose one representative bond futures basis factor from the workbook.

Determine whether HDS contains:

- The basis directly.
